# Plugin System Flowchart

## How Plugins Load

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Shell Starts] --> B{Read manifest.json}
    B -->|Valid| C[Load Widget.qml]
    B -->|Invalid| D[Skip Plugin]
    C --> E[Create Component]
    E --> F[Register in PluginRegistry]
    F --> G[Available for Shell Config]
```

## Plugin Lifecycle

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Plugin Directory] --> B[manifest.json]
    B --> C[Parse Metadata]
    C --> D[Load Entry QML]
    D --> E{Valid QML?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Component Ready]
    E -->|No| G[Error Log]
    F --> H[Shell Uses Component]
```